    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opponent's [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), right after an enemy unit finishes a Fall Back move. Pick 1 **DESTROYER CULT** or **FLAYED ONES** unit of yours that was within [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of the retreating unit when the phase began.\n\nRoll 1 D6 and inflict on the retreating unit:\n\n- 1: nothing\n- 2–5: D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)\n- 6: 3 mortal wounds\n\nThe chosen unit may afterwards make a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), ending as near as it can to the retreating unit.",
